WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.813 --> 00:00:02.581
- Have you ever been around

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:03.998
when someone dropped their iPhone

00:00:03.998 --> 00:00:05.597
and everyone reacts like
they just saw an old woman

00:00:05.597 --> 00:00:07.031
get hit by a bus.

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:11.876
- Sure yeah.

00:00:12.598 --> 00:00:13.220
- Oh sh!

00:00:13.922 --> 00:00:14.666
- Oh my god!

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:15.806
- Oh shit.

00:00:16.226 --> 00:00:17.144
(screams)

00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:22.147
(dramatic orchestra music)

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:28.695
- Ooh!

00:00:33.857 --> 00:00:34.780
(laughs)

00:00:36.713 --> 00:00:38.123
- Is your phone okay?

00:00:39.313 --> 00:00:40.791
- What happened to your phone?

00:00:57.353 --> 00:00:58.663
- Zach, no.

00:00:58.663 --> 00:01:00.145
Oh my god!

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:03.317
- I just got a new phone so.

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:05.551
- Dude, are you kidding me right now?

00:01:05.551 --> 00:01:06.735
- Oh Jesus.

00:01:06.735 --> 00:01:08.711
- This is all, this is a setup, isn't it?

00:01:08.711 --> 00:01:09.566
(laughs)

00:01:09.566 --> 00:01:10.475
- Are you serious!

00:01:10.475 --> 00:01:11.339
Son of a bitch!

00:01:11.339 --> 00:01:12.083
(laughs)

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:14.077
- Oh my god, I felt so bad.

00:01:14.731 --> 00:01:18.407
I was like we should make like
a Kickstarter for your phone.

00:01:18.407 --> 00:01:20.468
(laughs)

